type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"<p>Smag og baghistorie<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h3","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_Y78dUL":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>En eksplosion af appelsin, citrusskal og sydens sol på flaske.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h3","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_EdRG9W":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Måske du kender det? Du har spist færdig på en restaurant i Italien, og med regningen følger en iskold Limoncello. Vores orange-likør rammer lidt samme ’vibe’. Af saftige appelsiner og citroner fra Middelhavet iblandet spiritus, produceret med omhu og en god portion spiritus.<br\/><br\/>Vores destillatør Jens Christian var tæt på en tennisalbue, efter at have revet skallen af omkring 100 øko-appelsiner og -citroner – og det smages! Her er masser af citrusskal med alt, hvad det indebærer af duft, parfume og aroma fra de naturlige citrusolier. Det er som en Vodka-juice, bare ekstra friskt, kraftfuldt og læskende.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_wNWfqc","text_Y78dUL","text_EdRG9W"],"name":"t:names.rich_text_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":25,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"small","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":48,"padding-block-end":28}},"section_er63c6":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_BnRJgY":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>servering<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h3","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_LBezWG":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Smid den i fryseren og nyd den, som en iskold opstrammer eller en frisk afslutning efter en god middag. Men det stopper ikke her! For vores orangelikør er også fremragende i drinks og cocktails. Prøv den som erstatning for Cointreau sammen med en god tequilla i en Margarita, sammen med en god cognac i en Sidecar eller med rom, mandelsirup og limesaft i en tropisk Mai Tai – hvilket sjovt nok betyder ”fremragende” på tahitisk. Det samme tør vi godt sige Fjords nye klassiker. Vores orangelikør er ikke bare god, den er fremragende.<br\/><br\/><strong>Serveringsforslag<\/strong>: <br\/>Nyd den afkølet – direkte fra fryseren! Brug den som hovedingrediens i en Margarita, Mai Tai, Sidecar eller Orange Tom Collins eller Orange Fizz.<br\/><br\/><strong>Ingredienser<\/strong>: <br\/>Øko-appelsiner, øko-citroner. Naturlige citrusolier fra håndrevet citrusskal. 24% alkohol, 500 ml.<br\/>42% alkohol, 500 ml.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_BnRJgY","text_LBezWG"],"name":"t:names.rich_text_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":25,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"small","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":28,"padding-block-end":48}},"section_gH46zC":{"type":"section","blocks":{"image_LzQTmD":{"type":"image","name":"t:names.image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Unavngivet_3.png","link":"","image_ratio":"adapt","width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mo